# MEILUS & CO.

Easy to use DAW online.

## Installation

1. Git clone and go to main directory
```bash
git clone https://github.com/adomas457/Meilus-Co-Sound.git
cd Meilus-Co-Sound
```

2. Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)

3. Install and pin python 3.12.3
```bash
uv python install 3.12.3
uv python pin 3.12.3
```

4. Install dependencies
```bash
uv sync
```

5. Run backend
```bash
uv run backend/main.py
```

6. Run frontend (on a different terminal)
```bash
uv run frontend/main.py
```
